OL,3,GNEWSACut cables leave shops unable to
OL,4,Atake card payments
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses have been left unable to use
OL,7,Fcard machines for payment after
OL,8,Felectrical cables were cut in an
OL,9,Fincident being treated as criminal
OL,10,Fdamage.
OL,12,FCables on North Street in Bedminster,
OL,13,FBristol, are thought to have been
OL,14,Fdamaged in the early hours of Sunday
OL,15,Fmorning, leading to multiple businesses
OL,16,Fhaving to only accept cash as payment
OL,17,Ffrom customers.
OL,19,FAvon and Somerset Police were contacted
OL,20,Fabout the incident on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
