OL,3,GNEWSACut cables leave shops unable to
OL,4,Atake card payments
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We were called about an incident of
OL,7,Fcriminal damage where electrical cables
OL,8,Fat NatWest bank in North Street,
OL,9,FBedminster, were reported to have been
OL,10,Fcut," said a spokesperson.
